{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CftKN7cNVnUp9mRkVStA7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Recommendation: don't approve two more months of personalisation. Pause the build and run a short diagnosis (2–3 weeks) with kill criteria agreed in advance.**\n\n**Why \"close\" isn't supported by the data**\n- **Most users never found it or didn't want it.** 91% never opened the planner. Personalisation only improves the experience for people who open it, so it can't fix that.\n- **Openers didn't come back.** Of the ~180 who tried it, ~24 used it in a second week, so about 87% left after one try. That points to a value problem, not a tuning problem.\n- **No business impact.** Basket value was the same as matched non-users. Even the self-selected enthusiasts didn't spend more, which is weak support for a lift at scale.\n- Five months of work produced no signal. \"Two more months\" is a sunk-cost pattern unless the team can say which specific number personalisation will move, and why.\n\n**Caveats before killing it outright**\n- 24 repeat users is too few to measure anything with confidence.\n- A 9% open rate might reflect poor placement, not lack of demand. Check where the entry point sat.\n- Basket value may be the wrong metric. Order frequency, retention, or time to checkout could matter more for a planner.\n\n**What to do instead**\n1. Interview the 24 repeat users and a sample of one-time users. What did they expect, and what went wrong?\n2. Run a cheap placement test, such as a homepage slot or a prompt in the order flow, to see whether discovery is the bottleneck.\n3. Test a non-AI version, like curated shoppable meal bundles, to see if the underlying need exists at all.\n4. Agree thresholds up front, for example ≥20% weekly repeat use among openers and a measurable lift in order frequency. If they aren't met, shelve the planner and reuse what's salvageable, such as recipe-to-basket tooling.\n\nFund the diagnosis, not the roadmap."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3189,"cache_read_input_tokens":5000,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3189},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"083f1385-b218-4725-a05f-6229da1c0f9c","uuid":"7435dd46-96de-47eb-98e5-316d9d58a240","timestamp":"2026-10-10T09:26:45.518Z","request_id":"req_011CftKN7Lk31pdHX5xdm9g2"}
